      "subject": "maina a ditšhaba",
      "rationale": "Lenane la ditšhaba tše tharo-pedibohlano (Tarshishe, Pule, Lude, Tubale, Yavane) — nomoro ya batho ba fapanego ba dikepeng tše di kgolego."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "משכי קשת",
      "rationale": "'ba goago uta' — ge e ba go Lude goba go ditšhaba ka moka; bafofetiši ba fapana."
    },
    {
      "kind": "hapax",
      "subject": "כרכרות",
      "rationale": "Dirilwana tša go palama ka tatellano (dipitse, dikoloi, dikgwaro, diphere, dikamele tša lebelo) — mokgwa wa Sesepedi wa go bala dilo ka moka."
    }
